{"id":"n14102-1-9","stage":2,"title":"영향 · 影响","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14102-1-9-1","ko":"지수야, 너 이번 감기 때문에 시험에 영향을 많이 받았겠다.","zh":"智秀啊，你这次因为感冒，考试应该受到了很大影响吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감기","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때문에","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"때문：因为，由于；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"때문","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64555","senseId":"1","lemma":"때문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시험에","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영향을","meaning":"影响","explanation":"영향：影响；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"영향","audio":"/audio/5528424f5f612845dbac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14102","senseId":"1","lemma":"영향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받았겠다.","meaning":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","explanation":"받다：接受，遭受，经受，承蒙；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"3","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"e7ce9cf0ec012e05","term":"때문","zh":"因为，由于","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3","entryId":"64555","definition":"表示原因或理由。","pronunciation":["때문"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"5528424f5f612845","term":"영향","zh":"影响","audio":"/audio/5528424f5f612845dbac.mp3","entryId":"14102","definition":"某个事情的效果或作用涉及到其他事情的行为。","pronunciation":["영ː향"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到他人行为、心理作用等的影响。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b54c09930a5a5bdbc13f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14102-1-9-2","ko":"응. 그래서 힘들었어.","zh":"嗯。所以才这么辛苦啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘들었어.","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有花费很多力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dff0aebcb9ef315f8cef.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.589,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14102","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.3143,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。所以才这么辛苦啊。","智秀啊，你这次因为感冒，考试应该受到了很大影响吧。","你的房间自己打扫一下吧。桌子上积了厚厚的灰尘呢！"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀啊，你这次因为感冒，考试应该受到了很大影响吧。","你的房间自己打扫一下吧。桌子上积了厚厚的灰尘呢！","嗯。所以才这么辛苦啊。"],"answer":2}]}
